        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-contrast-ke-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Add a contrasting fact with 可",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "可 can begin a contrasting clause, much like 可是. Here it links two claims: the book is useful, but ownership limits what the speaker can do with it.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书很有用，可它不是我的。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū hěn yǒuyòng ， kě tā bù shì wǒ de 。",
                "meaning": "This book is useful, but it is not mine.",
                "audio": "50db9453a2c68177d7bd4590656b4a918707075d7e1763794f0d0b3bd183b287"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
